<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Forward interim shr slips, no div.</title>
<headline>Forward interim shr slips, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)	 20.8	 vs    27.1</p>
<p>    Attrib income	    41.15	 vs    50.80</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    48.51	 vs    69.33</p>
<p>    Tax			   6.91	 vs    7.38</p>
<p>    Interest paid	     0.84	 vs    34.12</p>
<p>    Share of associates'    3.55 loss  vs    11.51</p>
<p>    Turnover		1,826.71	 vs    1,824.42</p>
<p>Full name: Forward Corp Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said dividends were considered on a full year financial basis. It said results for the next half would show a seasonal pattern similar to that experienced in the six months to June 1996.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
